# adb-root (LineageOS "rooted debugging") integration neutered.
#
# The edges below let adbd reach the adbroot helper, which stock user builds never
# expose. Integrity detectors (e.g. Duck Detector's DirtySepolicy access oracle)
# flag "adbd -> adbroot:binder call: Allowed" as aftermarket-policy evidence, so the
# adbd side of the path is removed. The adbroot domain/service still exist in policy
# but are now unreachable from adbd. Restore these to re-enable adb root:
#   allow adbd adbroot:binder call;
#   allow adbd adbroot_service:service_manager find;
